# widget

A widget: the fixture for a type declared in package core.

## Overview

The page head: its own `##` sections, verbatim.

- a list item
with an unindented continuation line
- a second item

| operator | reading |
| --- | --- |
| `w + x` | exactly `append(x)` |

### A third-level heading

```go
w := widget()

w.len()   // 0
```

